set.seed(12345)
student.id <http://student.id> <- paste("student", 1:50, sep=".")
Calculus <- round(rnorm(length(student.id <http://student.id>), mean=65, sd=10), 0)
LinearAlgebra <- sample(1:100, length(student.id <http://student.id>), replace = TRUE)
da <- data.frame(student.id <http://student.id>,Calculus,LinearAlgebra)
da
ifelse(da[,2]>=60&da[,3]>=60,"佳",ifelse(da[,2]<50&da[,3]<50,"危險","要加強"))

我算如果兩科成績都大於60,叫佳
兩科都小於50,叫危險
其他叫要加強

如果我想計算"佳"的個數要如何產生

